Subject: [PATCH 02/10] drm: qcom: integrate Y700 display and panel support

Consolidate the TB320FC display driver, panel, backlight, SM8475 PHY,
timing and bonded PLL fixes from the tested 7.2.6 queue. Initial bring-up
was recorded by Codex; the following later local commits name dianqk.

